EmbeddingGemma 2 by Google DeepMind, converted to GGUF Q8_0 by ggml-org.
Both pinned upstream model cards declare Apache-2.0 and are included unchanged.
Converted repository revision: bfcd298762cc34d0357ece5ebdd31791a3a374d8
Original Google model revision: 914f7f89142e33e77833254d9c9b90c3cef7303b
The converter repository .src_sha binds the original model revision.
Samosa uses the existing converted text model unchanged; no new quantization.
Native llama.cpp engine is MIT licensed; full notice is included.
The package does not contain vision/audio projectors or qualify media embeddings.
